"""
NER Consistency Service for Bergur Monitor
This module contains service classes for:
1. BaseNERScorer - base class providing shared functionality for NER scorers
2. NERConsistencyScorer - for calculating NER consistency scores between rule-based and spaCy extraction
3. RuleDefinitionScorer - for evaluating the quality of rule definitions for entity recognition
4. NERConsistencyChecker - main class combining both scorers for backward compatibility
"""

